    "turn_text": "Pleasure is all mine. Am I listeners? Let's start at the border. I think one of the reasons Donald Trump won and handily won the election is because of the chaos the Biden administration unleashed on the American public at large by not shutting down the border or doing something to control the unmitigated massive feel flow of humanity. Scream people in democrat cities, the blue democrat cities are screaming their bloody heads off at town halls and public meetings yelling at their democrat mayors for not doing something about it. The resources being soaked up, schools are overwhelmed. Are we going to get some sense back on the border? Can we shut it down? And can we even unring the bell of the millions that have already flown into our country?",
