    "turn_text": "You were elected along with the rest of the House and Senate to do oversight. You are performing a function on behalf of the American people. Those people who are stonewalling you, Senator Rand Paul and the rest of the elected officials are supposed to be answerable to you. And the idea under any circumstances that they would refuse this information from you when you have formed a select committee to look into it I find absolutely appalling and inexplicable absent as you point out something nefarious going on in the background.",
