  {
    "episode_id": 94485,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/4/94485.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "I am too, and I love hearing these words out of your mouth because, you know, that fuels conspiracy theories. I mean, every time this concept comes up, someone usually emails me or sends me a message or otherwise communicates with me saying, well, the reason they don't want anybody to know about this is because this was all about global population control. They wanted a lot of people to die. And I'm thinking to myself, you know, really? Is that really part of someone's agenda? Well, I don't know. They won't let us know. They have never explained to us what the point was of doing gain of function research along these lines was in the first place.",
